OL,3,ATrain operator renationalised after 30
OL,4,Ayears
OL,5,
OL,6,FChiltern Railways has been brought into
OL,7,Fpublic ownership after 30 years as a
OL,8,Fprivate company.
OL,10,FIt is the 10th rail company now under
OL,11,Fthe Great British Railways (GBR), the
OL,12,Fgovernment's programme of public
OL,13,Fownership, which it says will save
OL,14,Fmoney and improve services.
OL,16,FChiltern Railways, which was privatised
OL,17,Fin 1996, operates services from London
OL,18,FMarylebone to Buckinghamshire,
OL,19,FOxfordshire and Warwickshire, as well
OL,20,Fas destinations in the West Midlands.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
