OL,3,ATrain operator renationalised after 30
OL,4,Ayears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said the transfer into
OL,7,Fpublic ownership would tackle
OL,8,Fovercrowding by introducing 25
OL,9,Fadditional daily services from
OL,10,FDecember.
